# Libraries

This directory contains reusable firmware modules for the ESP32
Firmware Template.

## WiFiManager

Location:

lib/WiFiManager/

Provides:

- WiFi STA connection
- AP fallback
- Captive Portal
- NVS WiFi configuration
- Automatic reconnection
- WiFi scanning
- Hardware reset

## OTAManager

Location:

lib/OTAManager/

Provides:

- Firmware update over WiFi
- OTA update management
- Firmware update status and error handling

The WiFiManager and OTAManager are designed as independent modules
so they can be reused across ESP32-based projects.